REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# LIFE_CELL_SOAT1 — SOAT1 sterol O-acyltransferase 1 (SOAT1/ACAT1-ER) after DHCR24 on sterol continuum
# Continuum ...->nsdhl->hsd17b7->ebp->sc5d->dhcr7->dhcr24->soat1 (SOAT1 after DHCR24)
# Gift: SOAT1 esterifies free cholesterol into CE storage after DHCR24 under ASSERT after Bloch+KR seal.
# Domain: post-DHCR24 ER sterol O-acyltransferase cholesterol-ester storage ward.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY er OF Cell 1 44 0
ENTITY drop OF Cell 1 28 0
ENTITY ash OF Cell 0 18 0
ENTITY starve OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY nest OF Cell 1 52 0

SEND er set_threshold 10
SEND drop set_threshold 12
SEND nest set_threshold 8
SEND starve set_threshold 10

